Description: Codex runtime and bin files for offline hash inventory and matching runtime module versions
Author: Anonymous artifact collection
Version: 1.0
Id: aa03a871-01f8-4ebc-9e32-07fbe57e5c92
RecreateDirectories: true
Targets:
    -
        Name: Primary runtime executable files including staging directories
        Category: Apps
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\.cache\codex-runtimes\
        FileMask: '*.exe'
        Recursive: true
        Comment: Hash copied files with an offline inventory utility; the target itself collects files, not a hash-only listing.
    -
        Name: Primary runtime matching DLL files including staging directories
        Category: Apps
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\.cache\codex-runtimes\
        FileMask: '*.dll'
        Recursive: true
        Comment: Preserve exact runtime build for MVID matching of StartupProfileData method records. These files can be large.
    -
        Name: Primary runtime native Node modules
        Category: Apps
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\.cache\codex-runtimes\
        FileMask: '*.node'
        Recursive: true
    -
        Name: Codex bin executable files
        Category: Apps
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\AppData\Local\OpenAI\Codex\bin\
        FileMask: '*.exe'
        Recursive: true
        Comment: Exact versioned bin files support SHA-1 comparison with Amcache; folder hash names are not an IOC.
    -
        Name: Codex bin DLL files
        Category: Apps
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\AppData\Local\OpenAI\Codex\bin\
        FileMask: '*.dll'
        Recursive: true
    -
        Name: Codex CUA runtime executable files
        Category: Apps
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\AppData\Local\OpenAI\Codex\runtimes\
        FileMask: '*.exe'
        Recursive: true
        Comment: Keep CUA Node separate from the primary task runtime Node.
    -
        Name: Codex CUA runtime DLL files
        Category: Apps
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\AppData\Local\OpenAI\Codex\runtimes\
        FileMask: '*.dll'
        Recursive: true
